<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">TI - Ndendeule Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa jhuubhele kwa Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa jhuubhele jha Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitabo chuubhele cha Timocheyo ndi baluwa jhuubhele jhijhandikwe na ntenga Pauli kujhenda kwa mmola gwake Timocheyo. Baluwa jhuubhele Pauli kwa Timocheyo pange ikajhandikwe pahina na kujhomokela ughome gwake. Kipinde chenie, Pauli pakibha mu kipungo mu muche gwa ku Loma, mu chula jha 1:16. Pauli akibha nkoche jwa pahina hake na Timocheyo, na kipinde chenge ankemita ngita mwana mundo, Filemone, mu chula jha 2:22, Timocheyo 1:2; 1: 18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa jhenje ndi jhimo jha baluwa ncheche ya Pauli yanyandikile mundo jhumo jhumo na chi kwa lilongo lya bhando bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu. Baluwa henge itato ndi Timocheyo na Titu, na Filemone. Kipinde jha baluwa jhuubhele jha Timocheyo, piijhandikwa kwa lilongo lya bhando bhibhajheketii Kilichitu mu unahota nkolongwa gwa ku Loma pakibha na mang'ahe hake. Pange iwechekana ndi nhwalo ghuntehila Pauli abhe mu kipungo, na kunnobholela Timocheyo ahimbilile papeta mambu ghighajhundupa. Ngita chikibha mukitabo cha 1 Timocheyo, Pauli akankelewiye Timocheyo akichunge na bhabhola bhuwange, mu chula jha 1:16-18. Akanobholile hele Timocheyo napaha na kipinde cha mang'ahe palonge, mu chula jha 3:1.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghughabhii mukitabo</para>
  <para style="iot">Mu chula jha 1:1-2, Pauli atumbuu baluwa jhake kwa kunnyambucha Timocheyo. Na kunaghalakii ilebhe ipalwa kubholwa, mu chula jha 1:3-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Yene annobholela Timocheyo mang'ahe ghighapakukolela na ahimbilile, mu chula jha 2:1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhele ikelebhuwa akoto kuhenga ghanganandela na kumpe ndela jha maha jha kuhenga, mu chula jha 2:14-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli ikutila kwa kumpe malaghilo ghake Timocheyo, mu chula jha 4:9-9.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Ne Napauli natenga jwa Kilichitu Yecho kwa kupala Chapanga. Ndumitwe ndangache ughome gwatulaghila Chapanga mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho.<verse eid="2TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>Ninnyandikii mwe ma Timocheyo ma mwanango jhunimpahii hake.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ninnyope kwa Chapanga Tate gwito na Kilichitu Yecho Bhambo gwito ampele umbone na kiya na uteeke.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Uchengulo na malobhe gha kuleke mwojho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Ninchenguu Chapanga jhunintumikila kwa mwojho gwambone ngita chibhatehila akahoko bhango, ninchenguu kila pininkomboka machiko ghoha mu kunnyopa kwango kilo na muhe. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Pinikomboka maholi ghino mmi na kilolo hake kummona, kupala ndwele luhangano kumwojho. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Ndi punikomboka kihobholelo chino cha uchakaka, kihobholelo chakibhanacho mbujha gwino Loisi na hele majhe gwino Eunike. Manye kubhehe helahela namwe nkwete kihobholelo chenie. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Nhwalo gwa gheniya nanikombocha nnyedelele kukihenge lihengo likitoi champii Chapanga machiko ghanimekila mabhoko gwango. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Nhwalo Chapanga atupii jhe Uhuke gwake jwatutenda tujhoghope, nambo atupekiye Uhuke jwatupekeye makakala na mapalano na mwojho gwa kukilongocha tabhete.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Yene, mangakola jhe hone kwatangachii Bhambo gwito, kabhele mangakola jhe hone nhwalo gwango nenga jhundabhitwe mu kipungo kwa nhwalo gwake. Nambo uhimbilile mu malagho pamonga na nenga kwa nhwalo jha Lilobhe lya Mbone kwa kutangatilwa na makakala gha Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Chapanga atukombwii, atukemite tutame utamo gwa unyahinyahi, chi nhwalo gwa itendwa hito yambone, nambo ngita chapahii jwenio Chapanga na kwa umbone gwake. Ngatupila umbone gwenio kupete Kilichitu Yecho kabula nnema nakupanganwa jhe. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Nambo umbone uyekulilwe hotuhotu kwito ngohe kwa kuhika kwa Nkomboche gwito, ndi Kilichitu Yecho. Jwenie ahangabhine makakala gha kuwegha na kwa ndela jha Lilobhe lya Mbone ngayekwila ndaa ughome gwa machiko ghoha gwangapeta.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Chapanga ngahagwila ne mme natenga na mmola kwa nhwalo jwa kwatangachii bhando Lilobhe lya Mbone, <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>gheniya ndi ghighameka naghe ngoheno. Nambo ne nipwele jhe nhwalo chakaka niumanye hotuhotu jhunihobholela, kabhele manye jwenie nambekeya ulonda, ade lichiko lela. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Nkamuu mbone mabholo gha uchakaka ghinimmolite ngita kilandanikiho kwino. Nnyendelele mu kihobholelo na mapalano ghabhii mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Kilebhe chela chamaha mukilonde kwa makakala gha Uhuke gwa Chapanga jwaitama nkate jhito.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Ngita chiumanye, bhando bhoha bhubhabhii ku kilambo cha ku Asiya bhannekite, pakate jhabhe abhii Fugelo na Helimogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Ninnyopa Bhambo aikole kiya nyumba jha Onesifolo, kwa nhwalo akauhanganiche mwojho gwango pipipi. Ngolite jhe hone nhwalo gwa kutabhwa kwango, <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>pahikita tu ku kilambo chuku Loma, ngambaliya hake ade ngatukongina. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Ninyopa Bhambo ankole kiya kwa lichiko lela luhadabulo pulupa kuhika! Na mwenga umanye twe ghamaha ghantendii kwenio ku Epecho.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Nkomana ngondo jwa kuhobholeka jwa Yecho Kilichitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Bhahe, mwe ma mwanango Timocheyo, mma na makakala mu umbone ghitupatite mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Na mabholo ghunyohina nikatangacha palonge jha bhando twe, gheniya mabhola bhando bhibhahobholeka na bheniya bhihoto kwabhola bhando bhange.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Mwe nhimbilila malagho pamonga na nenga ngita nkomana ngondo jwaumbone jwa Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Nkomana ngondo jwabhii kungondo ihenga jhe mahengo gha ughome gwa kila lichiko nambo ihenga mahengo gha kungondo, kupala kunhalalicha nkolongwa jwa akakomana ngondo.<verse eid="2TI 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Helahela kwa mundo jhojhoha jwailongocha pumubhutuka mbelo ihoto jhe kupata hupo jha kubhutuka changakengama malaghalikilo ghighabhekwitwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Jwalema hake ipalwa atumbula kupata mahuno. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Mughabheka umwojho gheniya ghinilonge, nhwalo Bhambo nantenda umanya ghanga ghoha.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Munkomboka Kilichitu Yecho, jwayokichwe kuhumii mukuwegha, jwahumi mulukolo lwa Daude, ngita chililonge Lilobhe lya Mbone linitangacha. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Kwa nhwalo gwenio ne ning'ahika na ndabhitwe minyololo ngita namwiye. Nambo Lilobhe lya Mbone lya Chapanga litabhwa jhe minyololo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Kwa yenio nihimbilii kila kilebhe ku nhwalo gwa bhando bhibhahaghulilwe na Chapanga, na bheniya hele bhapata ukomboche ghubhii nkate jha Kilichitu Yecho na kuleta ung'alicho gwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Lilobhe lende ndi la uchakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Anda tuhwii nako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">helahela natutama nako pamonga.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Anda tujhendilile kuhimbilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">natulongocha pamonga na jwenio.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Anda tunkanite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">na jwenio helahela natukana twenga.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Anda tuhobholeka jhe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">jwenie najhendelela kuhobholeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">nhwalo jwenie ihoto jhe kukolowa.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhenga lihengo jwajheketilwe na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Bhahe, makombocha bhando bhino mihalo jhenje na kwakelebhuya palonge jha Chapanga bhakotoka kung'aulana kwa malobhe ghanganandela. Mitaho jhene ihalalii jhe, nhwalo kilebhe chenie chahobhecha bhibhajhokanikiya. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Nkachane kuhenga ilebhe ihalalii Chapanga, mme maunhenga mahengo mambone jwangaikole hone lihengo lyake na kone abhola telatela malobhe gheniya gha chakaka gwa Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Mme kutale na mihalo jha undindilima na jhangahalalii Chapanga, nhwalo jhene ujhendelele kwabheka bhando bhabhehe kutale na Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Mabholo ngita gheniya ghiwanana ngita mabhanga ndela ghangalama lililye yegha. Pakate jha bhando jwabholita ilebhe yenio ndi Humeneyo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Bheniya bhailekite kutale ndela jha uchakaka, na ndi bhihangabhana kihobholelo cha bhando bhange kukulonge uyokecho kwa bhando bhoha upetite. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Nambo nchinge ghuchengwitwe na Chapanga ujhemite nganganga. Na panane jhake ghajhandikwe ghanga, “Bhambo abhamanya bhando bhake,” na “Kila mundo jwalonge jwenie ndi jwa Bhambo, ndi alekane na uhakaho.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Munyumba ngolongwa ibhii jhe yombo ya madine gha feza na chaabo tugha nambo ibhii yombo ya mikongo na undope henge itopela na yangatopela. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Anda mundo akijhelehwiye na kubhehe kutale na yombo yenio yangatopela nabhaha chombu cha kuhenge mahengo gha kanjika, nhwalo akipihite na kutumika na Bhambo na akilenganikiye kuhenga kila lihengo lilibhii lyambone. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Mukibhambaye na tama mboho ya ungombo na ntame tela ngita chapala Chapanga, na mme kihobholelo na upalo na uteeke pamonga na bhando bhoha bhibhannyopa Bhambo kwa mwojho gwamaha. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Mukibhambaye na mitau jhanganandela na jha umbebhebhe, mabhene umanya kuhenga yenio kwileta bhulo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Ntumiche jwa Bhambo akomana jhe, ipalwa abhaha jwanuu kwa bhando bhoha, jwahoto kubhola na kuhimbilila, <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>jwanuu pakelebhuya bhando bhibhakomana, nhwalo bheniya Chapanga ahoto kwaghalambula na kuuleka uhakaho gwabhe na kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Peniya, malango ghabhe ghabhujhii kabhele, na kupokonyoka muntambo gwa Jwanganandela jwabhajhonjite na kwatenda bhatende chapala jwenio.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Machiko ghukupehekela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Nkomboka kubhehe mu machiko gha ghukupehekela ghapakubhehe ndi machiko gha malagho. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Bhando nabhakipala bhene, nabhapala mbijha na bhibhakikweya na bhina ngandango nabhannigha Chapanga, na bhangajhokanikiya akatate bhabhe, na bhangaluchenguu na bhangannyinamii Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Bhando bheniya nabhabha bhanga mapalano na bhangapala kujhelana na bhina uwange na bhahoto jhe kukilongocha na bhina ukale na bhangapala ghambone. <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>Bhando bheniya nabhabha bhibhajhambii bhajhabhe na bhihenga changaholelela na bhibhakiloka na bhibhakipala bhene kuliku kumpala Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Kwa panja nabhabhonekana ngita bhando bhibhannomba Chapanga, nambo bhikana makakala ghake. Mkibhambahe hake na bhando ngita bheniya. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Pakate jha bhando bhange bhijhenda munyumba jha bhando na kwakolowa akakeghe mandindilima bhibhatopilwilwe na mihigho jha uhakaho na bhibhalongochwa na tama mboho jha kila kilebhe. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Akakeghe bheniya bhijhigha kukibhola kila lichiko nambo bhihoto jhe kuhikii kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Bhando bheniya bhikana uchakaka ngita Yane na Yambule chibhankanila Mucha. Bheniya ndi bhando bhibhahobhite mu malango ghabhe na bhakanilwe mu ilebhe ya kihobholelo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Nambo nabhahoto ng'o kujhendele hake nhwalo undindilima gwabhe naubhonekana hotuhotu kwa bhando bhoha, ngita chikibha kwa Yane na Yambule.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghilo gha kujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Nambo mwenga ma Timocheyo, maghakengime mabholo ghango na matyangilo ghango na chimbala mu kutama kwango. Na hele mukikengime kihobholelo chango na kuhimbilila kwango na mapalano ghango na kulendele kwango, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>kubulwa kwango na kulagha kwango. Kabhele mughamanye ghighangolile kwenio ku Antiyokiya na ku Ikonilo na ku Lusita. Ngaimbilila kulagha kwenio kukolongwa muno! Nambo Bhambo ngang'ombwila mugheniya ghoha. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Kila mundo jwaipala kutama kwa kunhalalii Chapanga mu kulombana na Kilichitu Yecho nalagha. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Bhando bhanganandela na bhibhakoloya nabhajhendelela kubhehe bhanganandela hake, na bhibhakoloya bhange na kongo bhene bhikopokewa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Nambo mwenga nnyendelele kutama mu uchakaka ghola ghumolitwe punyeketila. Nhwalo mamanye bhala bhibhamolita, <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>na nkomboka kuhumii uhwana gwino mughamanye Majhandiko gha Chapanga gheniya ghahotwii kunete malango ghinnongocha mu ughombokeko kwa kuhobholela Kilichitu Yecho. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Majhandiko ghoha gha Chapanga ghabhii na Uhuke gwa Chapanga na ghahoto kunyangatii kubhola chakaka na kukelebhuya na kulangii malemo na kwalongocha bhando bhatame maha palonge jha Chapanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>mundo jwantumikii Chapanga abhaha na kila kilebhe chakipala mukuntumikii Chapanga na ahoto kuhenga mahengo ghoha ghambone.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Ninaghalikii palonge jha Chapanga na palonge jha Kilichitu Yecho jwapakwahadabuu bhando bhubhabhii ghome na bhubhawile, nhwalo ihika kulongocha abhii Munahota Nkolongwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Mwatangachila bhando lilobhe lya Chapanga, mpanganike kutangacha kwa kipinde chambone amu kipinde chambone jhe na mwapwatalila na mwakelebhuwe na kwaleke bhando mwojho makabhola kukuhimbilila kwoha. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Nalihika lichiko bhando nabhajhokonikiya jhe mabholo gha uchakaka, nambo nabhakengama chibhakipala bhene na kukipalakiya akabhola twe nabhalongolela ghala ghighapala kujhoha mu machikilo ghabhe. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Nabhakana kujhokanikiya uchakaka, nabhaighalambukila omo yuwange. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Nambo mwenga mukichunge mu kila kilebhe, nhimbalila malagho nhwenge lihengo lya kwatangachii bhando Lilobhe lya Mbone na nnenganikiya maha lihengo lino.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Nhwalo nenga mmii pahina na kupiwa ngita litambiko lya kujhakana na kipinde chango chukuwe kibhandikile. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Ngomine ngondo maha, nnyomwii mwanja gwango na kihobholelo nikikamulii njelembo. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Ngohe nilende kupata ndweko jha kubhehe naumbone palonge jha Chapanga. Bhambo jwahadabula chiipalwa nambela ndweko jhene lichiko lyenie, ne tujhe nambo bhala bhoha bhibhalole kwa kilolo kubhujha kwake.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli innaghii Timocheyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Nkangamale kuhika kwa ne kajhombe. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Nhwalo Dema apahi ilebhe ya pannema pano nganekita nu kujhenda ku Tesolonike, ku Kelesike ajhahwii ku Galatiya na Titu ajhahwii ku Dalematiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka tugha ndi jwabhii pamba pamo na nenga. Muntole Maluku uhike nako pamba, kwa nhwalo nahotola kundangatila mu lihengo lyango. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>Tikiko nintumite ku kilambo chuku Epecho. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Pampala kuhika ung'eghela likote lyango linekita kwa Kipulo ku kilambo chuku Tiloya, helahela unnetela itabo, achwa hela itengenichwe kwa limbendela.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Jhola punde kuyana Alekichanda andendi ghanganandela twe, Bhambo nannepa kwa ghala ghandendile. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Na mwe mukichunge na jwenio nhwalo akakanite lilobhe lito.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Pundumbwila kukengelela akibha jhe mundo jwajhemite upande gwango, bhoha ngabhanekita. Chapanga akoto kwabhalangila ulemo gwenio! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Nambo Bhambo ngatamita pamonga na nenga, ngambila makakala, ade nganhotwila kwatangachila bhando bhoha, kwa bhando bha ilambo henge bhajhohe, kabhele ngangombolilwa mu luhadabulo lwa kuwe ngita kunkombola munnomo gwa lihimba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bhambo nang'ombola na ghanganandela ghoha na kumbeleka njelembo ade munahota nkolongwa gwake jwa kunane kwa Chapanga. Ung'alicho ubhaha kwa jwenio kwa machiko ghoha ghangapeta! Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nyambuchilo jha kujhomolela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Majhambuche Pilichila na Akula, pamonga na bhando bhubhabhii ukajha kwa Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Elasito ngahighalika ku Kolintu, na jwenio Tilofimo nganinekita ku Mileto, nhwalo atehila kulwalwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Nnyombihane kuhika kabula jha kipepo kinahika jhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ebulo na Pude na Lino na Kilaudiyo na akalongo bhange bhibhannyeketii Kilichitu bhinnyambucha.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bhambo atame na mwenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Ninnyope mabhoha umbone gwa Chapanga.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
